$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tmcpredenc  LOC_AFTER=?

* Decrementing the encoding of a positive number gives the encoding of its predecessor (Lean ` canon_predBits ` with ` toNat_predBits ` ): equal values (T4 ~ tonatpredbits ) and equal lengths (the bit length of ` F - 1 ` drops exactly when ` F ` is a power of two, ~ blchar ).

